{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfc;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#2b6cb0;--accent-2:#6b46c1;--accent-3:#0ea5a8;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}    
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;line-height:1.4;color:#111827;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f6f7fb);margin:0;padding:0}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(250,250,252,0.9));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2f7}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:#374151;text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    .primary-cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}

    main{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:24px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.06);}

    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}

    .contact-form label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin:10px 0 6px}
    .contact-form input,.contact-form textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;font-size:14px}
    .contact-form textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row .half{flex:1}

    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:16px}
    .switch{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;padding:6px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid rgba(43,108,176,0.08)}
    .switch button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;color:#255a9b;cursor:pointer}
    .switch button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(43,108,176,0.12)}
    .prices{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .price-card{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #fbfdff);border:1px solid #eef6ff}
    .price-figure{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .price-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}
    .mood{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;background:white;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#374151}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-3),#7dd3fc);color:#042a2b}
    .approach{margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff);border:1px solid #eef2f7}
    .approach h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px}
    .approach p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    footer{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* small responsive */
    @media (max-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.primary-cta{padding:8px 10px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TH</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Why Work</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="primary-cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="card">
          <h1>Connect — a simple way to begin</h1>
          <p class="lead">If you're ready to talk about what feels urgent or confusing, use the form below or reach out by phone or email. I prioritize a clear, practical plan in our first conversation.</p>

          <form id="contact" class="contact-form" onsubmit="handleContact(event)">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your full name" required />

            <div class="row">
              <div class="half">
                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />
              </div>
              <div class="half">
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="note">Brief note about what you'd like to address</label>
            <textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="What brings you here today?"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px">
              <button type="submit" class="primary-cta" id="submitBtn" data-primary="{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div class="meta">I aim to respond within 48 business hours. This form is not monitored for emergencies. If you are in crisis, call your local emergency number or a crisis line immediately.</div>
          </form>

          <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9" />

          <div>
            <strong>Pricing snapshot</strong>
            <div class="comparator" style="justify-content:space-between">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">View:</div>
                <div class="switch" role="tablist">
                  <button id="tab-monthly" class="active" onclick="setPricing('monthly')">Monthly</button>
                  <button id="tab-package" onclick="setPricing('package')">Focused package</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Approximate values</div>
            </div>

            <div class="prices">
              <div class="price-card">
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Short sessions</div>
                <div class="price-figure" id="figure-brief">—</div>
                <div class="price-sub">per session</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price-card">
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Focused plan</div>
                <div class="price-figure" id="figure-package">—</div>
                <div class="price-sub">total program</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Prices are presented as a clear comparison to help you choose what fits your current needs. Exact fees and availability will be confirmed in our first contact.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
          <strong>Mood & method</strong>
          <p class="meta">Select how you feel right now — the page will suggest an approach and adapt the primary button text to match next steps.</p>

          <div class="moods" id="moods">
            <button class="mood" data-key="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="stuck">Stuck</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="transition">Transitioning</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="coping">Coping, want more</button>
          </div>

          <div class="approach" id="approachBox">
            <h3>Suggested next step</h3>
            <p id="approachText">Choose an option above to see a tailored starting plan. This is not a diagnosis — it’s a practical starting point we can revise together.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Contact details</strong>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">
            Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a><br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a><br />
            Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}
          </div>

          <hr style="margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9" />

          <div>
            <strong>How a first call works</strong>
            <p class="meta">A 20–30 minute call to clarify concerns, confirm fit, and review options: single sessions, short-term focused plans, or referrals. If therapy seems right, we'll discuss scheduling and paperwork.</p>
          </div>

          <hr style="margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9" />

          <div>
            <strong>Boundaries and confidentiality</strong>
            <p class="meta">I follow standard clinical confidentiality with limits: risk of harm to self/others, suspected abuse, or court-ordered requests. I do not provide emergency services. For immediate danger, contact emergency services or a crisis line.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <strong>Quick links</strong>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><a href="fees.html">Fees & options</a></div>
          <div style="margin-top:6px"><a href="book.html">Book an intake</a></div>
          <div style="margin-top:6px"><a href="faq.html">Frequently asked</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>This site describes therapeutic services and is intended for informational purposes. It is not a substitute for professional emergency care. If you are experiencing a crisis, contact local emergency services or your crisis line.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator values
    const PRICING = {
      monthly: { brief: 140, package: 720 },
      package: { brief: 120, package: 540 }
    };

    let currentPricing = 'monthly';

    function setPricing(key){
      currentPricing = key;
      document.getElementById('tab-monthly').classList.toggle('active', key==='monthly');
      document.getElementById('tab-package').classList.toggle('active', key==='package');
      animateNumber(document.getElementById('figure-brief'), PRICING[key].brief);
      animateNumber(document.getElementById('figure-package'), PRICING[key].package, true);
    }

    function animateNumber(el, end, isTotal){
      const start = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-last')||'0',10);
      const duration = 700;
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function tick(now){
        const p = Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/duration);
        const val = Math.round(start + (end-start)*easeOutCubic(p));
        el.textContent = (val===0? '—' : (isTotal? '$'+val : '$'+val));
        if(p<1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
        else el.setAttribute('data-last', end);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    function easeOutCubic(t){return 1 - Math.pow(1-t,3)}

    // Mood-to-Method mapping
    const METHODS = {
      overwhelmed: { title: 'Short-stabilizing sessions', desc: 'Weekly briefs to manage immediate stressors and create simple routines to reduce overwhelm. These sessions focus on practical steps you can use between meetings.', ctaSuffix: 'Short call' },
      stuck: { title: 'Targeted skill-building', desc: 'A focused sequence of sessions that emphasize skill practice, values-based goals, and checking what works. A clear, measurable plan to shift a stuck pattern.', ctaSuffix: 'Discuss a focused plan' },
      transition: { title: 'Transition support pathway', desc: 'Guided work for life changes: decisions, role shifts, or relationship transitions. We attend to practical choices and emotional processing together.', ctaSuffix: 'Plan transition support' },
      coping: { title: 'Maintenance + growth', desc: 'If you are managing but want steady progress, we’ll set up a rhythm for reflection and strategic changes to keep building resilience.', ctaSuffix: 'Set ongoing support' }
    };

    document.getElementById('moods').addEventListener('click', function(e){
      const btn = e.target.closest('.mood');
      if(!btn) return;
      document.querySelectorAll('.mood').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));
      btn.classList.add('active');
      const key = btn.getAttribute('data-key');
      const m = METHODS[key];
      document.getElementById('approachText').textContent = m.title + ' — ' + m.desc;

      // Update primary CTA text to reflect recommended next step
      const submit = document.getElementById('submitBtn');
      const base = submit.getAttribute('data-primary') || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
      submit.textContent = base + ' — ' + m.ctaSuffix;
    });

    function handleContact(ev){
      ev.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value||'Friend';
      const submit = document.getElementById('submitBtn');
      submit.disabled = true; submit.textContent = 'Sending...';
      setTimeout(()=>{
        submit.disabled = false;
        submit.textContent = submit.getAttribute('data-primary') || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
        alert('Thank you, ' + name + '. Your message has been queued. I will respond within 48 business hours.');
        document.getElementById('contact').reset();
      },900);
    }

    // Initialize UI
    setPricing('monthly');
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the private practice therapist site (layoutFamily: clinic_modern).

What this file contains:
- contact.html: a self-contained contact page with an interactive pricing comparator and a Mood-to-Method selector. It adapts the primary CTA text according to the user's selected mood and animates price numbers when toggling between monthly and package views.

Key features and behaviours:
- Pricing Comparator: toggle between 'Monthly' and 'Focused package' views. Numbers animate smoothly to communicate relative cost differences for brief sessions and a focused program.
- Mood-to-Method selector: four mood states (Overwhelmed, Stuck, Transitioning, Coping) that morph the suggested approach blurb and update the main CTA button text to match a logical next step.
- Contact form: captures name, email, phone and a short note. Form submission is simulated in-page and displays a confirmation alert. The form explicitly notes it is not for emergencies.
- Accessibility notes: buttons are standard elements, meaningful labels are present, and color contrasts are chosen for legibility.

Placeholders to be provided by the site generator/environment:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Clinical and legal language included:
- Confidentiality summary, boundaries, and a clear crisis/emergency notice.
- No medical claims; language is supportive and grounded.

Integration notes:
- Nav links assume the rest of the site pages exist at the top-level: index.html, about.html, specialties.html, approach.html, fees.html, faq.html, book.html, contact.html.
- No external assets or CDNs are used. The page references a local pattern asset (assets/img/pattern.svg) optionally for background treatment in the broader site but does not require it to function.

Developer guidance:
- The pricing values are defined in PRICING at the top of the script and can be adjusted to match the clinician's actual fee structure.
- The METHODS mapping drives mood->approach copy and CTA suffixes. Update to reflect clinical offerings and tone.
- The submit handler is a placeholder; integrate with your backend form endpoint or email workflow as needed.

This page is intended to feel practical and calm while giving visitors a clear starting point for contacting the clinician and understanding possible next steps."}
